\label{tab:goodhart-landscape}
\end{table*}

\paragraph{Low-dose ISR ($\beta{=}0.1$): ISR-specific gaming.}
Table~\ref{tab:goodhart-landscape} summarizes results across conditions. At $\beta{=}0.1$, two of three ISR seeds (s43, s44) are dominated by H7---the model generates a single premise identical to the conclusion, trivially achieving both high PR and high ISR. Across the three ISR seeds, H7 accounts for 64.5\% of proved samples (149/231), compared to 0\% under all three random control seeds (0/256). H7 is exclusively induced by the ISR reward signal.

